{"id": "q0010", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2992997385, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "In November, a toy was $40. In December, the price increased by 80%. In January, the price decreased by 50%. What was the price of the toy after it was discounted in January?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0010.wav", "input_sha256": "4ae53f05706a64f084a4ee706c6742b88e8096bc8de8cae092ccdd3910366db6", "input_samples": 241600, "input_s": 15.1, "n_real_chunks": 16, "score": 0.3061, "act": 0.9974, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "November price: $40 December increase by 80%: \\[ 40 \\times 1.80 = 72 \\] December price: $72 January decrease by 50%: \\[ 72 \\times 0.50 = 36 \\] So the price after the January discount was: \\[ \\boxed{36} \\] Final numeric answer: 36", "expert_answer": "November price: **$40**\n\nDecember increase by 80%:\n\n\\[\n40 \\times 1.80 = 72\n\\]\n\nDecember price: **$72**\n\nJanuary decrease by 50%:\n\n\\[\n72 \\times 0.50 = 36\n\\]\n\nSo the price after the January discount was:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{36}\n\\]\n\nFinal numeric answer: **36**", "transcript": "In November, a toy was $40. In December, the price increased by 80%. In January, the price decreased by 50%. What was the price of the toy after it was discounted in January? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 4.07, "expert_s": 3.86, "expert_input_samples": 241600, "expert_input_s": 15.1, "expert_input_sha256": "4ae53f05706a64f084a4ee706c6742b88e8096bc8de8cae092ccdd3910366db6", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 35051, "on