{"id": "q0068", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4093614844, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "In a family, there are 2 brothers and 3 sisters. All sisters are the same age, which is 16. One of the brothers is 12 years old, which is half the age of the older brother. What is the total age of all these siblings?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0068.wav", "input_sha256": "ec3173c9c40b131f065591b344ef6b49756d2d167f3d63288d359278d48b5179", "input_samples": 284400, "input_s": 17.775, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.1616, "act": 0.9972, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Three sisters: \\(3 \\times 16 = 48\\) Younger brother: \\(12\\) Older brother: \\(12 \\times 2 = 24\\) Total age: \\(48 + 12 + 24 = 84\\) Final numeric answer: 84", "expert_answer": "Three sisters:  \n\\(3 \\times 16 = 48\\)\n\nYounger brother:  \n\\(12\\)\n\nOlder brother:  \n\\(12 \\times 2 = 24\\)\n\nTotal age:  \n\\(48 + 12 + 24 = 84\\)\n\n**Final numeric answer: 84**", "transcript": "In a family, there are two brothers and three sisters. All sisters are the same age, which is 16. One of the brothers is 12 years old, which is half the age of the older brother. What is the total age of all these siblings? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.05, "expert_s": 2.45, "expert_input_samples": 284400, "expert_input_s": 17.775, "expert_input_sha256": "ec3173c9c40b131f065591b344ef6b49756d2d167f3d63288d359278d48b5179", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.385, "relay_synth_ms": 19251, "onset_chunk": 18, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_