{"id": "q0078", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3940854717, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Tim makes a special honey and jam mix.  To make 1 jar of the mixture it takes 2 pounds of passion fruit and 1.5 pounds of jackfruit.  It also takes 2 pounds of special honey.  The passion fruit costs $6 per pound, the jackfruit is $8 per pound, and the honey is $10 per pound.  He sells each jar for $50.  How much profit does he make selling 10 jars?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0078.wav", "input_sha256": "5e06c8d44142b8a572c0e0aa75dbca4641e14c61dab2c0457be5cd300311d100", "input_samples": 437600, "input_s": 27.35, "n_real_chunks": 28, "score": 0.3716, "act": 0.9987, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Cost to make 1 jar: Passion fruit: \\(2 \\times \\$6 = \\$12\\) , Jackfruit: \\(1.5 \\times \\$8 = \\$12\\) , Honey: \\(2 \\times \\$10 = \\$20\\) Total cost per jar: \\[ 12 + 12 + 20 = 44 \\] Selling price per jar: \\[ \\$50 \\] Profit per jar: \\[ 50 - 44 = 6 \\] Profit for 10 jars: \\[ 10 \\times 6 = 60 \\] Final answer: 60", "expert_answer": "Cost to make **1 jar**:\n\n- Passion fruit: \\(2 \\times \\$6 = \\$12\\)\n- Jackfruit: \\(1.5 \\times \\$8 = \\$12\\)\n- Honey: \\(2 \\times \\$10 = \\$20\\)\n\nTotal cost per jar:\n\n\\[\n12 + 12 + 20 = 44\n\\]\n\nSelling price per jar:\n\n\\[\n\\$50\n\\]\n\nProfit per jar:\n\n\\[\n50 - 44 = 6\n\\]\n\nProfit for **10 jars**:\n\n\\[\n10 \\times 6 = 60\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: 60**", "transcript": "Tim makes a special honey and jam mix. To make one jar of the mixture, it takes 2 pounds of passion fruit and 1.5 pounds of jackfruit. It also takes 2 pounds of special honey. The passion fruit costs $6 per pound, the jackfruit is $8 per pound, and the honey is $10 per pound. He sells each jar for $", "asr_s": 1.25, "expert_s": 3.44, "expert_input_samples": 437600, "expert_input_s": 27.35, "expert_input_sha256": "5e06c8d44142b8a572c0e0aa75dbca4641e14c61dab2c0457be5cd300311d100", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.151, "relay_synth_ms": 71916, "onset_chunk": 27, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0078_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "e65804d811cf5c4c92c6438a20a223e4a18cdb2965fdcc8db23c8fd33b8a16cb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 136.4}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0078_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "d10fcb3552148b0b79589ee5e151bfbd895ee0f4bb011962690895cc761abdcb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0078_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "9e95df97290700c7d8acbf10ff33fbedf7b1aa06d4489cdfd707412c1ab551d2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 0.76}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.069, 1.126, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.073, 2.135, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.083, 3.148, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.071, 4.127, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.074, 5.13, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.073, 6.132, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.072, 7.129, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.072, 8.128, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.072, 9.129, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.074, 10.129, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.073, 11.127, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.078, 12.144, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.075, 13.131, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.081, 14.141, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.076, 15.134, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.078, 16.137, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.086, 17.156, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.075, 18.13, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.08, 19.139, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.087, 20.149, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.085, 21.157, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.085, 22.145, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.084, 23.144, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.082, 24.142, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.083, 25.147, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.079, 26.138, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.084, 27.144, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 27.35, 27.44, 28.049, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 27.35, "last_real_feed_done": 27.44, "onset": 28.049, "gate_read_done": 28.049, "fire": 28.049, "candidate_first_pcm": 28.049, "stall_note": 28.052, "stall_first_pcm": 28.585, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 28.585, "expert_req": 28.051, "expert_resp": 32.737, "relay_synth_start": 32.737, "relay_first_pcm": 33.525, "relay_synth_end": 104.654, "first_any_pcm": 28.049, "first_answer_pcm": 33.525, "session_end": 105.567}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.175, "ttfa_any_s": 0.699}
{"id": "q0100", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2864504703, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Let $P(x)$ be a monic polynomial of degree 3.  Suppose that $P(x)$ has remainder $R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 1)(x - 4),$ and remainder $2R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 2)(x - 3).$  Given that $P(0) = 5,$ find $P(5).$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0100.wav", "input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "input_samples": 271400, "input_s": 16.962, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.8957, "act": 0.9962, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Let \\[ p(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+5 \\] since \\(p(x)\\) is monic cubic and \\(p(0)=5\\). If \\(p(x)\\) has remainder \\(r(x)\\) when divided by \\((x-1)(x-4)\\), then \\(r(x)\\) is linear.", "expert_answer": "Let\n\n\\[\np(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+5\n\\]\n\nsince \\(p(x)\\) is monic cubic and \\(p(0)=5\\).\n\nIf \\(p(x)\\) has remainder \\(r(x)\\) when divided by \\((x-1)(x-4)\\), then \\(r(x)\\) is linear. Let\n\n\\[\nr(x)=mx+n.\n\\]\n\nUsing \\(p(1)=r(1)\\) and \\(p(4)=r(4)\\):\n\n\\[\nm+n=a+b+6\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4m+n=69+16a+4b\n\\]\n\nSubtracting gives\n\n\\[\nm=21+5a+b.\n\\]\n\nThen\n\n\\[\nn=a+b+6-m=-20-4a.\n\\]\n\nAlso, \\(p(x)\\) has remainder \\(2r(x)\\) when divided by \\((x-3)^2\\), so\n\n\\[\np(3)=2r(3), \\qquad p'(3)=2r'(3).\n\\]\n\nCompute:\n\n\\[\np(3)=32+9a+3b\n\\]\n\n\\[\nr(3)=3m+n=43+11a+3b\n\\]\n\nSo\n\n\\[\n32+9a+3b=2(43+11a+3b)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n13a+3b=-54.\n\\]\n\nAlso,\n\n\\[\np'(x)=3x^2+2ax+b\n\\]\n\nso\n\n\\[\np'(3)=27+6a+b.\n\\]\n\nSince \\(r'(x)=m\\),\n\n\\[\n27+6a+b=2m=2(21+5a+b)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4a+b=-15.\n\\]\n\nSolving\n\n\\[\n13a+3b=-54,\\qquad 4a+b=-15\n\\]\n\ngives\n\n\\[\na=-9,\\qquad b=21.\n\\]\n\nThus\n\n\\[\np(x)=x^3-9x^2+21x+5.\n\\]\n\nFinally,\n\n\\[\np(5)=125-225+105+5=10.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{10}\n\\]", "transcript": "Let p x dots be a monic polynomial of degree 3. Suppose that p x has remainder r x when it is divided by x minus 1, x minus 4, and remainder 2r x stars when it is divided by x minus 3. Given that p zero equals 5, find p 5. Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.42, "expert_s": 16.84, "expert_input_samples": 271400, "expert_input_s": 16.962, "expert_input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 17.224, "relay_synth_ms": 57824, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 240, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 240, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "477492b4804d35b756e15a01a46568aa82058d034b319827701fe63c08ef8f2c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 118.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "b21f514204eede6a90d99a64aa6dd5046f91c0b4c572d5c74f5619b29f46a68e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "3849d1b4fd4dbe820766dd3b4766361ae3a92216d8b9b44d4738902fdd8386e1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.072, 1.13, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.134, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.076, 3.133, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.076, 4.138, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.072, 5.132, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.076, 6.135, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.075, 7.135, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.075, 8.131, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.074, 9.129, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.073, 10.13, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.073, 11.131, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.072, 12.129, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.075, 13.131, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.076, 14.133, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.0